{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：17:05 2026-09-16 HKT</p>\n\n<p>由宏安發展的黃大仙新盤薈淳，已累售119伙，發展商今日（16日）首度曝光現樓示範單位及會所，即日起開放參觀。</p>\n<img alt=\"由宏安發展的黃大仙新盤薈淳，已累售119伙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aed86b66e45d78794a94070ce9c5f427/2026-09/PS260916CN702.jpg\" title=\"由宏安發展的黃大仙新盤薈淳，已累售119伙。\"/>\n<p>宏安執行董事程德韻指出，項目今日首度開放現樓及會所，開放的6個現樓單位，為16樓的B、F、H、J至L室，面積202至520方呎，涵蓋開放式、2至3房間隔，即日起開放現樓參觀。至於全盤則已累售119伙，套現逾7.7億元。</p>\n<p>今曝光的現樓16樓H室及F室，為連傢俬單位，H室面積520方呎，為3房1套戶，採橫廳設計，外連共38方呎的露台及工作平台，可外望區內市景，主人房設轉角窗，預留有衣櫃位置，另外兩間睡房分別作兒童房及書房。</p>\n<h2>薈淳16樓F室連傢俬示範單位：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4e84aa33bbf7f097216cf912892a4fb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_08_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b136a57b6c41b8150d914ebe3851983c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_10_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc639ba412ed0f16fdae5f2007d37cbe/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_09_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dcbdf1fb921d766b0c3e4c3bd46398bc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_08_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b563ec3aa2783368c6d84ed3a2c70585/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_10_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7a30d59d3d78b86fda24f7178c64d92/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_07_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>F室面積462方呎，同屬3房間隔，客廳佈置有沙發及地櫃，飯廳設圓桌，兩間睡房與廳同向，房內靠窗放置有睡床，另一房則有書枱，作書房使用。</p>\n<h2>薈淳16樓F室連傢俬示範單位：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/079dd2feee626ccf56d7c7acf2124230/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_45_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c45f0b9659338b7092fdb408987084f6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_47_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ac5042f7a85cffc57e76dfee376faad/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_47_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa40d976463fe07be0998360682c2fc2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_46_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48fed4c5ba61df1cba6210c58113a0b2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_46_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c14223942e09cc796e199282017d358c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_46_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f85ce8d4ea8c987d808df93ee386b174/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_47_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6fb96ad2ade1ed192bc877a4b8b2c8b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_46_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/304a9b6d578c556ffe154f0b781d0cf9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_32_45_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>會所Club Connext 設有7大主題設施，包括健身室、兒童遊樂室、多用途宴會廳、戶外燒烤區等。</p>\n<h2>會所Club Connext：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1ffc0380b4f3fa146a41cda6e472dec/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_45_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d60c9ccd0d70a053e6be8c0e4c801bc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_44_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f1df0a512867917e0c94169813ec0a0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_46_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cda7942f0c4222b2f9136eaa9c5a9c73/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_45_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/509f7492254508976dd40bea5e59e117/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_45_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6976af46fa51db3844b4683741bd4aef/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_44_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e11687255c43d7fa85cd599a2c98e34a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_4_33_44_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>相關文章：黃大仙薈淳開價 首批50伙 每呎1.8萬 開放式戶398萬入場 樓花期僅約5個月</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T10:59:08.574856+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":505,"images":23,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}